      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oriskany%2C_New_York",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Oneida people founded the village of Oriskany in the eighteenth century.",
